# Story 105: Overflow Menu & Pane Actions (40s)
# Hook: Long-press a pane on mobile and the full action menu opens up.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-105-overflow-menu-pane-actions.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 5

[00:00.0 --> 00:05.0]
Long-press a pane on mobile and the full action menu opens up.

[00:05.0 --> 00:15.0]
A long-press, or the overflow menu, gives you the common pane actions: copy the output, rename the pane, or share it.

[00:15.0 --> 00:25.0]
There is a terminal focus control too -- you decide when keystrokes go into the pane versus when you are just scrolling and reading.

[00:25.0 --> 00:34.0]
And rotating to landscape works cleanly -- the on-screen keyboard is handled with keyboard avoidance so it never covers the pane you are typing in.

[00:34.0 --> 00:40.0]
Everything you need to manage a pane -- one press away.

